    sec2_p3: "Performance of legitimate interests (GDPR Art. 6(1)(f)): Communication, coordination of lesson schedules, archiving correspondence history, and preserving necessary documentation in the event of potential disputes or the need to verify the course of study.",
    
    sec3_title: "§ 3. Status of Working Notes and Pedagogical Materials",
    sec3_p1: "All notes, observations, progress logs, and information about the Student's preparation represent the Tutor's internal working materials.",
