    sec4_p1: "Data is stored for periods strictly related to the purpose of processing and the legal requirements of the Kingdom of Norway:",
    sec4_p2: "Pedagogical data and correspondence: Stored for a period of up to 3 years from the end of cooperation, which is directly linked to the statutory limitation periods for contractual claims under Norwegian law (foreldelsesloven § 2).",
